    "note": "House engrossed, 2019-02-08. Struck: 'any' -> 'an', plural -> singular wording only. Quote is Section 1 as printed after amendment; Sections 2-3 parallel it. The House passed it (House Do Pass Amended 53-16, 2019-02-08); later amendments are not in the text read. Not quoted: Section 2 (SDCL 8-5-13) and Section 3 (SDCL 9-19-20): the same rule for townships and for municipalities (the municipal text omits the word 'tax')."
